# Records what the player sees (every shown frame, not a fresh render) while the investments list
# scrolls like a wheel and the overview flips through its views, for checking by eye:
#   scripts/frames-to-video.sh investments-scroll --sheets
# A line drawn one row late after a scroll lasts only a frame or two; it shows in the frames.
# Assumes nothing about what the city holds.
name investments recording: smooth scrolling and the overview's views, every frame saved
close-economy
investments-list on
show-economy
wait 1.5
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsList
record investments-scroll FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsList
wait 0.5
investments-scroll-smooth 600 2
wait 0.3
expect-sparks-in-rows
investments-scroll-smooth -300 1
wait 0.3
expect-sparks-in-rows
investments-scroll-smooth -400 1
wait 0.3
expect-sparks-in-rows
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewTab-Market
wait 0.4
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewTab-Portfolio
wait 0.4
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewTab-Heatmap
wait 0.4
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewHeatmapSpan-30
wait 0.4
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewHeatmapSpan-1
wait 0.4
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewTab-City
wait 0.4
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewTab-Feed
wait 0.4
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewTab-Market
wait 0.4
record-stop
cleanup:
record-stop
investments-list restore
close-economy
